        "translation": "Humility is regarded as moral because it continually urges us to respect everyone. Everyone in this world needs respect and needs to be regarded as having value. When we sincerely respect others, we bring them happiness. But if we are to respect others, we must not see ourselves as better than they are; we must recognize our own smallness and shortcomings.",
