        "translation": "People of old said, “Only by respecting a teacher can one become a teacher.” The same applies here: by revering the Buddha, we gradually develop the Buddha’s qualities in our own minds. By revering a Noble One, we develop some of that person’s qualities. Of course, only some: we cannot compare with the merit accumulated through that Noble One’s practice over many lifetimes.",
