        "translation": "When conceit becomes overwhelming, sensual desire and craving gradually appear, even if we had previously remained pure. Some practitioners in a particular school may develop supernormal powers of healing, prophecy, and changing circumstances. But because they fail to maintain humility skillfully, they gradually come under the sway of conceit. According to the stern law of psychology described here, once conceit appears, craving and sensual desire follow.",
