        "translation": "Aggressiveness is a forceful manner that readily offends others. It resembles anger as a state of mind, but is not anger in essence. Aggressive people have forceful personalities and strong mental energy, so they often make others afraid. When something happens, their expression, gestures, and words become threatening, crushing other people’s morale and will and frightening them. Aggressive people also readily create karma; at times their aggressiveness leads them to inflict physical punishment on others.",
