        "translation": "Suppose we find ourselves in an awkward emotional situation: someone shows romantic interest in us when everything makes the relationship inappropriate—family, responsibilities, trust, happiness, and the morality of faithfulness. The person may be beautiful, wealthy, and well situated. Yet we love goodness more, give greater thought to responsibility, and hold faithfulness in higher regard, so we overcome the temptation.",
