        "translation": "A father pretends to sip his drink and talks about this and that while waiting for his children to finish eating; only then does he eat whatever is left. Money saved for a new motorbike is used instead to help a neighbor in distress. The working day has ended and it is time for a party, but an elderly man has been waiting so long that we stay much later to process his paperwork and spare him a return trip tomorrow. We have taken just one bite when a thin dog stares at our bread; seeing how hungry it is, we give it the rest. We notice a friend wearing the same shirt on three successive meetings and give away the new one in our bag. Graduation exams are approaching, but a friend still cannot solve the difficult math problems, so we set aside a month to tutor that friend.",
