        "translation": "With compassion that loves all sentient beings, we naturally feel driven to do something for their peace and happiness. The greater our compassion, the stronger that urge. The more deeply we understand the Dharma, the more clearly we see how much suffering life contains. Around us, if people are not suffering from one thing, they are suffering from another. No one is truly happy in every respect.",
